## TPCH2 — A three-hop analysis with middle conditions on two hops: the number of boundaries and aggregation absorption
traits: start=filtered scan hops=3 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-10 | R1 start: c.mktsegment | R3 middle: o.orderdate, l.discount | R6 aggregate / sort: p.brand, l.extendedprice

### TPCH2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(p.brand, lines, revenue)
  : Limit[10]
  :   Sort[revenue DESC, p.brand ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: p.brand | count(*) AS lines, sum(l.extendedprice) AS revenue]
  :       GetProperty(l.extendedprice) [node:Lineitem]
  :         GetProperty(p.brand) [node:Part]
  :           Expand((l)-[_r2:OF_PART]->(p:Part))
  :             Filter((l.discount >= 0.05))
  :               GetProperty(l.discount) [node:Lineitem]
  :                 Expand((o)-[_r1:CONTAINS]->(l:Lineitem))
  :                   Filter((o.orderdate < "1995-01-01"))
  :                     Filter((o.orderdate >= "1994-01-01"))
  :                       GetProperty(o.orderdate) [node:Order]
  :                         Expand((c)-[_r0:PLACED]->(o:Order))
  :                           Filter((c.mktsegment = "AUTOMOBILE"))
  :                             GetProperty(c.mktsegment) [node:Customer]
  :                               EntityScan(c:Customer)

### TPCH2 @relational
Coord Limit[10]
  Coord Sort[revenue DESC, p.brand ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: p.brand | count(*) AS lines, sum(l.extendedprice) AS revenue]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(l) out=(l, l.extendedprice)
        : GetProperty(l.extendedprice) [node:Lineitem]
        :   Argument(l)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(p) out=(p, p.brand)
          : GetProperty(p.brand) [node:Part]
          :   Argument(p)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(l) out=(l)
            : Filter((l.discount >= 0.05))
            :   GetProperty(l.discount) [node:Lineitem]
            :     Argument(l)
            StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o)
              : Filter((o.orderdate < "1995-01-01"))
              :   Filter((o.orderdate >= "1994-01-01"))
              :     GetProperty(o.orderdate) [node:Order]
              :       Argument(o)
              StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, l, o, p)
                : Expand((l)-[_r2:OF_PART]->(p:Part))
                :   Expand((o)-[_r1:CONTAINS]->(l:Lineitem))
                :     Expand((c)-[_r0:PLACED]->(o:Order))
                :       Argument(c)
                StoreQuery[mysql] out=(c)
                  : Filter((c.mktsegment = "AUTOMOBILE"))
                  :   GetProperty(c.mktsegment) [node:Customer]
                  :     EntityScan(c:Customer)

