## TPCH4 — A six-hop chain narrowed at both ends: middle conditions and whether to expand from both sides
traits: start=both ends hops=6 fan-out=high aggregate | R1 start: cn.name | R2 end: sn.name | R3 middle: l.shipdate | R6 aggregate / sort: l.extendedprice

### TPCH4 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(lines, revenue)
  : Aggregation[keys: ∅ | count(*) AS lines, sum(l.extendedprice) AS revenue]
  :   GetProperty(l.extendedprice) [node:Lineitem]
  :     Filter((sn.name = "FRANCE"))
  :       GetProperty(sn.name) [node:Nation]
  :         Expand((s)-[_r4:SUPP_IN]->(sn:Nation))
  :           Expand((l)-[_r3:SUPPLIED_BY]->(s:Supplier))
  :             Filter((l.shipdate <= "1996-12-31"))
  :               Filter((l.shipdate >= "1995-01-01"))
  :                 GetProperty(l.shipdate) [node:Lineitem]
  :                   Expand((o)-[_r2:CONTAINS]->(l:Lineitem))
  :                     Expand((c)-[_r1:PLACED]->(o:Order))
  :                       Expand((cn)<-[_r0:CUST_IN]-(c:Customer))
  :                         Filter((cn.name = "GERMANY"))
  :                           GetProperty(cn.name) [node:Nation]
  :                             EntityScan(cn:Nation)

